- op: discuss  # 0c9d
  at: '2026-03-11T05:02:06Z'  # 0c9d
  by: agent  # 0c9d
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 0c9d
  clock: 3  # 0c9d
  nonce: 0c9d  # 0c9d
  message: "Fixed in PR #2139. Expanded invoke regex to match TAURI_INVOKE and __TAURI_INVOKE__ patterns from tauri-specta generated bindings. Remaining gap: wrapper functions (commands.takeScreenshot()) that don't contain literal command names — these require call-graph tracing through generated bindings, a fundamentally harder problem."  # 0c9d
